  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups sugar",
    "1 (12 fluid ounce) can frozen juice concentrate - any flavor except citrus, thawed",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "3.5 quarts cold water, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n0GnZjlB1jFUgOHfECmZ0kHPrIw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58561_HomemadeWine_Step1_14670-0c7b4657eb444ceea403a50941025141.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58561/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sugar, juice concentrate, and yeast in a 1-gallon jug. Fill the jug the rest of the way with cold water. Stir or shake well until the sugar has dissolved and the mixture is well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse out a large balloon; fit it over the opening of the jug. Secure the balloon with a rubber band.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IGCjDeAtcz_NMnJ2U669CehN53E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58561_HomemadeWine_Step6_14694-d8cc77c50f6a4110aaf625287fb0d4f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58561/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place jug in a cool dark place. Within a day, you will notice the balloon starting to expand. As sugar turns to alcohol, gasses will release and fill up the balloon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fH0EbJlTRscP1Pqc6kZ_R_iwwH8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58561_HomemadeWine_Step5_14690-405082cebf80429abef899e6857d0603.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58561/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the balloon has deflated, wine is ready to drink. It takes about 6 weeks total.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IGCjDeAtcz_NMnJ2U669CehN53E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58561_HomemadeWine_Step6_14694-d8cc77c50f6a4110aaf625287fb0d4f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58561/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
